# Force LF for files consumed by Linux tooling. With core.autocrlf=true (the
# default on Windows clones), shell scripts and Dockerfiles would otherwise be
# checked out with CRLF and break the backend container: the entrypoint dies
# with `env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`.
*.sh                 text eol=lf
Dockerfile*          text eol=lf
docker/entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
